                <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-[1.8] mb-10 text-zinc-300 font-light">
                    For the traveler, the reward is more than just a bottle of wine. It is the ritual of the tasting—the way the aroma of wild cherries and dried herbs fills the room as a bottle of Riserva is uncorked. It is the texture of the homemade pappardelle, rich with wild boar ragu, that perfectly complements the wine's dusty tannins.
                </p>
